  "text": "The transaction is not the crime the network is Suspicious activity hides in the hops around a payment not in the wire itself Corridor Watch takes the network as the case One synthetic case shows the path A rule on one transaction flags the wrong object Cross-border mule and layering rings are not a single wire Funds can arrive rest for minutes and leave under another purpose A threshold cannot see that shared device The bank is left an alert and no memory of the network This console is the middle bank bank_SG Case CW-MID-02 is $9,050 Singapore to the Philippines Risk 91 Mule pass-through The queue marks it partial The badge reads Partial network observed Visibility is coverage not guilt 18 minutes earlier CW-MID-01 brought $9,200 in from India On shared device D-MID-MULE The object under review is the corridor Corridor Watch constructs that corridor before a model speaks Ingest never calls Gemini A 12-step investigation directed a cyclic graph DAG loads the payment both profiles risk features shared devices and the neighborhood then drafts a deterministic verdict from the evidence pack On this case the pill is high 91 The stated next step is a human decision not an automatic clear Downstream of the Philippines hop the graph keeps an unknown boundary It does not invent a bank Gemini does not see the raw ledger It receives that evidence pack At the model boundary account identifiers are tokens not customer names Forced Gemini explains only the pack why the case looks this way what is still unknown and what a person should check next The recommendation is to pause for an FIU lead The model cannot hold escalate or freeze The verdict carries a provenance chip Gemini tools pre-fetch grounded fallback or gate fail If the grounding gate rejects the report the chip reads Gate fail and the deterministic verdict stands Evidence chips cite the pack A claim has to point at one of them Consequential actions stay with the FIU lead Hold payment escalate and freeze account are refused for an analyst Here the lead records hold payment The rail moves to FIU lead That is a human authorization in this console It is not a core banking freeze Gemini recommended A person decided A confirming decision writes crime pattern DNA This network strengthens the multi-hop layering fingerprint in the library Confirmed investigations become reusable memory for the next case not a one-off alert The next network can match that fingerprint The library holds the pattern The single wire does not The transaction is not the crime The network is CorridorWatch turns investigations into institutional memory",
